{"id":"mv6s84ue-wn6j5h","at":"2026-10-13T14:34:28.358Z","listId":"b4","label":"Bonus Round in, Gamble out","author":"user","rationale":"Pilot's call 2026-10-13. Gamble is the only tutor, but drawn late with nothing else in hand it discards the card it found (ledger eval-024), and the pilot would rather draw or exile into Jeska's Will than tutor and risk binning it. Bonus Round costs {R}{R} under Ruby and copies every instant and sorcery cast after it that turn: rituals make double mana, X-spells keep X, and copiers are copied. It is symmetric, so equip Conqueror's Flail before casting it.","entries":[{"op":"add","name":"Bonus Round","section":"Copy and recur","replaces":"Gamble"},{"op":"remove","name":"Gamble"}],"snapshot":"versions/2026-10-13-1434-b4-bonus-round-in-gamble-out.json","before":{"size":{"total":100,"target":100,"lands":26,"nonland":74,"commanders":1},"curve":{"avgMv":2.68,"avgMvNonZero":2.87,"histogram":[{"mv":"0","creature":0,"noncreature":5},{"mv":"1","creature":0,"noncreature":11},{"mv":"2","creature":0,"noncreature":21},{"mv":"3","creature":5,"noncreature":12},{"mv":"4","creature":5,"noncreature":9},{"mv":"5","creature":1,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"6","creature":0,"noncreature":0},{"mv":"7+","creature":0,"noncreature":2}]},"types":{"creature":11,"instant":25,"sorcery":16,"artifact":20,"enchantment":2,"planeswalker":0,"battle":0,"land":26},"color":{"identity":["R"],"pips":{"W":0,"U":0,"B":0,"R":80,"G":0},"sources":{"W":10,"U":10,"B":10,"R":46,"G":10}},"roles":{"sections":{"Commander":1,"Lands":28,"Fast mana, rituals and cost reduction":18,"Per-spell and per-damage engines":5,"Seed — power on Wanda before the first X-spell":6,"The pump engine":1,"Doublers — X-spells and power doublers":10,"Copy and recur":7,"Card draw & selection":10,"Damage conversion & closers":4,"Protection":5,"Removal & interaction":3,"Reach and refuel that also seed":2},"tags":{}},"flags":{"gameChangers":["Ancient Tomb","Chrome Mox","Grim Monolith","Lion's Eye Diamond","Mana Vault"